WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.725 --> 00:00:02.933
- [Narrator] In northern Italy,

00:00:02.933 --> 00:00:04.982
in the foothills of the Alps,

00:00:04.982 --> 00:00:08.124
a collection of temples,
dedicated to the human spirit,

00:00:08.124 --> 00:00:10.291
sit 100 feet below ground.

00:00:14.488 --> 00:00:17.335
Built in secret over a period of 15 years,

00:00:17.335 --> 00:00:20.918
this is Damanhur, the
temples of humankind.

00:00:22.599 --> 00:00:26.099
(mellow electronic music)

